# Dual-App Vision (master ≠ stable-v5)

Two tracks, **different goals**. Never wholesale sync.

| Track | Branch | Purpose |
|-------|--------|---------|
| Preview / advanced | `master` | Features + soak. Free-scrape, smart polarity, experimental cascades OK. |
| Production / LTS | `stable-v5` | **Reliability only** after soak. No feature managers by default. |

## Before every change
1. Classify: `BOTH` (crash/security/timer/SDK3) | `MASTER_ONLY` (feature/scrape/smart-learn) | `STABLE_ONLY` (identity/publish).
2. Fix on **master** first for `BOTH`.
3. Backport to **stable-v5** surgically (adapt to stable code) — **never** copy App ID / version / whole trees.
4. Protect identity: `.homeycompose/app.json`, `package.json`, `app.json` per track.

## MASTER_ONLY (examples)
AlarmPolarity smart-learn, free-scrape / diag orchestrator, CapabilityCommandRouter `parallelDiscover`, multichannel/AVE, mega feature managers.

## BOTH (examples)
SOS `async _registerButtonCapabilityListeners` + `Promise.resolve(…).catch`, `safe-timers` instead of detached `homey.clearTimeout`, IAS `zoneId: 10`, `typeof auditCapabilities === 'function'`.

Full doctrine: `docs/rules/DUAL_APP_VISION.md` · `docs/rules/CROSS_APP_PROMPT_RULES.md`.
